{"id":2331,"date":"2024-08-01T16:05:41","date_gmt":"2024-08-01T09:05:41","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/?p=2331"},"modified":"2024-08-01T16:14:17","modified_gmt":"2024-08-01T09:14:17","slug":"pelaksanaan-pelatihan-lemmi-4-0-politeknik-stmi-jakarta","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/pelaksanaan-pelatihan-lemmi-4-0-politeknik-stmi-jakarta\/","title":{"rendered":"Pelaksanaan Pelatihan Lemmi 4.0 Politeknik STMI Jakarta"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Halo Sobat STMI!\u00a0 Pada hari ini, Kamis 1 Agustus 2024 telah dilaksanakan pelatihan Lemmi 4.0 Politeknik STMI Jakarta yang diikuti oleh mahasiswa tahun 2024.<\/p>\n<p>1. Pelatihan Lemmi 4.0 untuk Mahasiswa Tahun 2024 Politeknik STMI Jakarta<\/p>\n<p><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-2332 aligncenter\" src=\"https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/Picture-23-300x225.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" srcset=\"https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/Picture-23-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/Picture-23-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/Picture-23-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/Picture-23-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/Picture-23.jpg 1600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>2. Pelaksanaan Pelatihan Lemmi 4.0 untuk Mahasiswa Tahun 2024 Politeknik STMI Jakarta<\/p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-2333 aligncenter\" src=\"https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/Picture-24-300x225.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" srcset=\"https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/Picture-24-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/Picture-24-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/Picture-24-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/stmi.ac.id\/w